<!-- ============================ RAZINA 1 — MAPA EKOSUSTAVA ============================ -->

## Mapa ekosustava

<div class="info-card">
<span class="layer-broj">01 · <span class="lang-hr">4 arhetipa aktera</span><span class="lang-en">4 actor archetypes</span></span>
<div class="lang-hr">
<h3>Tko objavljuje i s kojim učinkom</h3>
<p>Prva razina mjeri volumen, doseg i angažman po platformama i izvorima. Na logaritamskoj karti dosega i angažmana, s rezovima na medijanima platforme, akteri se razvrstavaju u četiri arhetipa: <strong>Divove, Graditelje zajednica, Megafone i Specijalizirane aktere</strong>. Njihovi su položaji izračunati iz podataka, a ne procijenjeni.</p>
<p><a href="https://lusiki.github.io/DigiKat/pages/mapa/mapa.html">Mapa ekosustava — cijela analiza</a></p>
</div>
<div class="lang-en">
<h3>Who publishes, and to what effect</h3>
<p>The first layer measures volume, reach and engagement by platform and source. On a log–log map of reach against engagement, split at each platform's medians, actors sort into four archetypes: <strong>Giants, Community Builders, Megaphones and Specialists</strong>. Their positions are computed from the data, not estimated.</p>
<p><a href="https://lusiki.github.io/DigiKat/pages/mapa/mapa.html">Ecosystem map — full analysis</a></p>
</div>
</div>

::: {.featured-box}
::: {.lang-hr}
### Nalaz 1 — platforme imaju različite mjerne profile

Web-portali proizvode 69,2 % svih objava te bilježe 63,0 % interakcija i 40,6 % dosega. Facebook s 15,3 % objava nosi 47,4 % zabilježenog dosega, a YouTube s 11,4 % objava 15,8 % interakcija. Najproduktivniji je pojedinačni izvor hkm.hr, s 55.087 objava.

To je asimetrija opaženog volumena, zabilježenih interakcija i vendorski procijenjenog dosega. Te mjere nisu jednako definirane ni dostupne na svim platformama, pa razlike ne dokazuju veću komunikacijsku učinkovitost, seobu publike ni uzročnu podjelu funkcija među platformama.
:::
::: {.lang-en}
### Finding 1 — platforms have different measurement profiles

Web portals produce 69.2 % of all posts and account for 63.0 % of interactions and 40.6 % of reach. Facebook carries 47.4 % of recorded reach with 15.3 % of posts, while YouTube carries 15.8 % of interactions with 11.4 % of posts. The most productive individual source is hkm.hr, with 55.087 posts.

This is an asymmetry between observed volume, recorded interactions and vendor-estimated reach. The measures are neither defined nor available in the same way on every platform, so the differences do not establish greater communication effectiveness, audience migration or a causal division of platform functions.
:::

