::: {.lang-hr}
Projekt slijedi načela otvorene znanosti: javni su manifest korpusa, agregati bez teksta i URL-ova, kod i metodologija. Redci službenoga korpusa i puni tekst dostupni su samo kroz zasebno odobren pristup. Više o podacima donosi stranica [Baza podataka](https://lusiki.github.io/DigiKat/pages/baza.html).
:::
::: {.lang-en}
The project follows open-science principles: the corpus manifest, text- and URL-free aggregates, code and methodology are public. Official-corpus rows and full text require separately approved access. The [Database](https://lusiki.github.io/DigiKat/pages/baza.html) page has more on the data.
:::

::: {.lang-hr}
Korpus je istraživačka infrastruktura za opaženi dio hrvatskoga digitalnog prostora: 9 vrsta izvora i platformi kroz 6 kalendarskih godina, uz promjenu načina prikupljanja 2024. i nepotpunu 2026. godinu. Nije cjelovit popis medija ni vjerojatnosni uzorak populacije, ali javni agregati omogućuju provjeru kodiranih opisnih nalaza i razvoj novih analiza uz jasno navedene granice.
:::
::: {.lang-en}
The corpus is research infrastructure for an observed portion of Croatia's digital space: 9 source and platform types across 6 calendar years, with a collection-method change in 2024 and an incomplete 2026. It is neither a complete media census nor a probability sample, but its public aggregates allow coded descriptive findings to be checked and new analyses to be developed within explicit limits.
:::

